── section · look ──
  # MERGE REQUEST STATES  {row:0}
> review  a merge request awaiting your review  warning · bold  {row:1}
  fix  your merge request with conflicts, a needed rebase, a failed pipeline or open threads  error · bold  {row:2}
  ready  your merge request GitLab would merge now  success · bold  {row:3}
  waiting  your merge request waiting on approvals or a pipeline  info  {row:4}
  draft  your draft  muted text  {row:5}
  you  the reader, in place of their own name  accent  {row:6}
  team  a teammate's merge request, not asking you  secondary text  {row:7}
  bot  a merge request from a bot  muted text  {row:8}
  merged  a merge request that was merged  third accent  {row:9}
  closed  a merge request closed without merging  muted text · italic  {row:10}
  label  a merge request's labels  links and keys  {row:11}
  # PIPELINES  {row:12}
  passed  a pipeline that passed  success  {row:13}
  failed  a pipeline that failed  error · bold  {row:14}
  running  a pipeline that is running  info  {row:15}
  manual  a pipeline waiting for a manual job  info  {row:16}
  pending  a pipeline that has not started  muted text  {row:17}
  canceled  a pipeline that was canceled  muted text  {row:18}
  skipped  a pipeline that was skipped  muted text  {row:19}
  # TENANCIES  {row:20}
  code  a tenancy's code; its colour is the tenancy's own  tenancy's own · bold  {row:21}
  shown  a repo shown in merge requests  success  {row:22}
  hidden  a repo you have hidden  muted text  {row:23}
  # REPOSITORIES TREE  {row:24}
  band  the shade behind every other repo and its merge requests  overlays  {row:25}
  heading  the shade behind a tenancy's heading  overlays  {row:26}
  lines  the tree lines joining repos and merge requests  muted text  {row:27}
